Dear {!Contact.FirstName},
Our records indicate that you are ineligible to participate in the Starbucks College Achievement Plan because your FAFSA was rejected by the federal processor. You can visit FAFSA.ed.gov to make corrections and resubmit your FAFSA. Please call us at 480-965-3200 to discuss this further.
Sincerely, {!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}
Financial Aid and Scholarship Services Arizona State University PO Box 870412 Tempe, AZ 85287-0412 Phone: 1-844-278-6693
If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.
